WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.387
My portfolio opens by correcting its own headline. Then it does the same to a message from your team.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.033
Here is a sample: hotfix steps, the way they get typed in a chat.

3
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:18.509
Yellow marks a fact to keep. A red line is noise to cut.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:28.149
Every fact lands in a first draft. An AI model writes it from my brief, and code checks that no name or number was lost.

5
00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:36.326
In red, the questions the message leaves open. Drafting is the quick part. Getting them answered is the job.

6
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:40.842
Paste a message of your own at karandeshmukh dot dev.
